# BUZZBOLT: proof the game can be completed. From the title, the demo
# player picks the FIREFLY and clears all five waves on its own,
# pressing the buttons for real (no cheats). Then the ending, the
# credits, the high-score table and back to the title; the Saucer goal
# is earned and the win is saved.
game buzzbolt
cheat botship 2
botuntil state == 6 40000
expect won == 1
expect wave == 5
expect ship == 2
expect goals & 2
print score
print deaths
print best_mult_run
print es_avg1
print es_avg2
print es_avg3
print es_avg4
print es_avg5
# wave 3 is the hard one: more shots on screen than in waves 1, 2 and 4
expect wave3_spike == 1
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_wins == 1
expect save_runs == 1
expect save_best2 > 0
